                <div class="p-2">
                    <div id="introduction">
                        Sayori is a game bot developed by Shadowveil Studioz. This bot was started as beta game bot to
                        test the games before adding it to their other bot L.I.N.G.O, but the plan was changed and it
                        was decided to keep Sayori as an independed bot.
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2>History</h2>
                        <p>It all start in mid 2025, when Lingo was being buffed with unique features like friendship
                            and popularity. The developer <a title="Satviky" href="#">Satviky</a> wanted to add games in the bot and <a
                                title="Kaddu aka Saksham Gupta" href="#">Kaddu</a> volunteered to work on few games which can later be added on
                            L.I.N.G.O. <br> It is said that once the game were ready Satviky thought that making the
                            game bot, an actual bot will be profitable and that's where the Sayori came into the
                            picture.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2>Features</h2>
                        <p>Sayori have a lot of games, divided into many categories to test the teamwork, intuition, and
                            a lot more.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2>Games</h2>
                        <p>
                            Some of the most played games on Sayori are:
                        <ol>
                            <li><strong>Mafia:</strong>It is one of the social deduction games we have. It is played in
                                a group and required minimut 4 players to start. Once the game is started bot will DM
                                players their roles.
                                <ul>
                                    <li>The game starts, and mafia starts their killing spree.</li>
                                    <li>One after another players are dying. Everybody need to team up to find the mafias and eliminate them before every innocent civilian is killed.</li>
                                    <li>If the Mafia is the one one surviving then they win. If there is only one civilian left, then the victory goes to Mafias.</li>
                                    <li>Some of the civilians have special roles, letting them do cool things in the game [mostly they get to use their powers once only except doctor]</li>
                                </ul>
                            </li>
                        </ol>
                        </p>
                    </div>
